#: rc.cpp:219
msgid ""
"Click on the button below to package your creation.\n"
"In the next page you will be able to upload the package \n"
"on our servers. When you will upload it everyone will be able\n"
"to install your creation easily."
msgstr ""
"Klick op den Knoop nerrn, wenn Du Dien Wark inpacken wullt.\n"
"Bi den nakamen Schritt kannst Du dat Paket na uns Servers \n"
"hoochladen. Deist Du dat, köönt Jan un Allemann Dien Wark\n"
"eenfach installeren."

#. i18n: file: plasmagikdesigned.ui:448
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, packageButton)
#: rc.cpp:225
msgid "Package!"
msgstr "Inpacken"

#. i18n: file: plasmagikdesigned.ui:489
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:232
msgid ""
"If you want to upload the package you have just created on\n"
"our servers via KNewStuff, so that everyone can \n"
"download it immediately with a one-click procedure,\n"
"please do so by clicking on the button below."
msgstr ""
"Wullt Du dat Paket, dat Du jüst opstellt hest, mit KNewStuff na\n"
"uns Servers hoochladen, so dat all Lüüd un een bito dat mit\n"
"bloots een Klick daalladen un fuurts installeren köönt,\n"
"denn klick op den Knoop nerrn."

#. i18n: file: plasmagikdesigned.ui:496
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, uploadButton)
#: rc.cpp:238
msgid "Upload"
msgstr "Hoochladen"

#. i18n: file: welcomepage.ui:33
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, firstLabel)
#: rc.cpp:241
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:10pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">With this dialog you are "
"going to magically package your new  creation.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; "
"margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></"
"p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Your creation will need to "
"be in an empty folder, containing just the files you want to be packaged. "
"Please note that the <span style=\" font-weight:600; color:#000000;\">WHOLE "
"</span><span style=\" color:#000000;\">directory, with all its content, will "
"be packaged.</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; "
"margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></"
"p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If you are going to use a "
"custom license, please</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">remember to add a file "
"called '<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">COPYING</span>'  in the top level "
"of the directory you are going to package.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:10pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Mit dissen Dialoog kannst "
"Du en Paket för Dien Wark opstellen.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; "
"margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></"
"p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Dien Wark mutt binnen en "
"leddig Orner wesen, bloots de Dateien, de Du inpacken wullt, schöölt dor "
"binnen wesen. Beacht bitte: De <span style=\" font-weight:600; color:#000000;"
"\">hele</span><span style=\" color:#000000;\"> Orner, mit all sien Inholt, "
"warrt inpackt.</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; "
"margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></"
"p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Wullt Du en topasst "
"Verlööfnis bruken, föög bitte</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">en Datei mit den Naam "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">COPYING</span> binnen de böverste Evene "
"vun den Orner to, den Du inpacken wullt.</p></body></html>"

