#: uploader.cpp:230
msgid ""
"You choose to use a custom license. Please remember to add a file in the "
"root directory of your creation called \"COPYING\" that contains your license"
msgstr ""
"Du wullt en topasst Verlööfnis bruken. Beseker bitte, Du hest binnen Dien "
"Wark sien Wörtelorner en Datei mit den Naam \"COPYING\" mit Dien Verlööfnis "
"dor binnen toföögt"

#: uploader.cpp:251
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The file %1 already exists. If you continue, this file will be silently "
"overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de Datei %1 al. Maakst Du wieder, warrt se eenfach överschreven."

#: uploader.cpp:258
#, kde-format
msgid "The file %1 already exists. Do you want to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Dat gifft de Datei \"%1\" al. Wullt Du ehr överschrieven?"

#: uploader.cpp:260
msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Överschrieven"

#: uploader.cpp:327
msgid "Some problem occoured during the packaging operation."
msgstr "Bi't Inpacken geev dat Problemen."

#: uploader.cpp:333
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The argument is a filename"
msgid ""
"Your creation has been successfully packaged!<br>You can find it at: <b>%1</"
"b>"
msgstr "Dien Wark wöör mit Spood inpackt!<br>Dat liggt nu binnen <b>%1</b>."

#: uploader.cpp:336
msgid "Plasmoid Packaged!"
msgstr "Plasma-Lüttprogramm inpackt"

#: uploader.cpp:346
msgid ""
"Sorry, you must fill in all the fields before we can package your creation. "
"Please fill in all the fields completely."
msgstr ""
"Deit mi leed, man Du muttst all Feller utfüllen, ehr sik Dien Wark inpacken "
"lett."

#: uploader.cpp:348
msgid "Have you filled in all the fields?"
msgstr "Hest Du all Feller utfüllt?"

#: uploader.cpp:353
msgid "The folder that contains the content you want to package does not exist"
msgstr "Den Orner mit de Saken, de Du inpacken wullt, gifft dat nich"

#: uploader.cpp:359
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You are going to package the %1 folder <br>Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr "Du wullt den Orner \"%1\" inpacken.<br>Wullt Du redig wiedermaken?"

#: uploader.cpp:373
msgctxt "Do _NOT_ translate 'COPYING'"
msgid ""
"Sorry, we cannot create the package of your creation because we cannot find "
"any acceptable license.\n"
" Have you specified a valid license? If you wish to use a custom license, "
"you must make sure to include it in a file called<b>COPYING</b>."
msgstr ""
"Deit mi leed, man Dien Wark lett sik nich inpacken, dor lett sik keen "
"passlich Verlööfnis finnen.\n"
"Hest Du en gellen Verlööfnis angeven? Wullt Du en topasst Verlöönis bruken, "
"muttst Du en Datei mit den Naam <b>COPYING</b> bifögen."

#: uploader.cpp:377
msgid "Could not find any acceptable license"
msgstr "Keen passlich Verlööfnis funnen"

#: uploader.cpp:381
msgid ""
"The file you have specified does not exists. Please make sure that you've "
"chosen the right file."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de Datei, de Du angeven hest, nich. Beseker bitte, Du hest de "
"richtige Datei angeven."

#: uploader.cpp:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt><b style=\"color: red\">***WARNING, WARNING, WARNING!!!***</b><br>It "
"seems that you are going to package your ENTIRE home directory. This is not "
"what you want in the 99.999% of the cases, and in any case it will take a "
"lot of space on the disk and a lot of time to complete.<br>Are you sure you "
"want to continue?</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b style=\"color: red\"> Wohrschoen:</b><br>As't lett wullt Du Dien "
"HELEN Tohuusorner inpacken. Dat wullt Du wull nich redig doon, un so un so "
"bruukt dat en Barg Platz op de Fastplaat un veeeeel Tiet.<br>Wullt Du redig "
"wiedermaken?</qt>"
